    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakaanīji babīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ninhwa idete lya kūpimīla, lya kūbiza gītī nang'ha; nūwīlwa gīkī, “Būūkaga wīpime ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu nū ng'walīlo; na a balamya baamo ūbabale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī gwalugwa ya hanze īlekage ūtizīpima, nguno ī yene binhilwe banhū ba mahanga; bakūgūtobanga ū nzengo ng'wela ikanza lya myeji makūmi ane n'ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaanīji bane babīlī nakūbinha būdūla bahange ikanza lya shikū shihūmbī na magana abīlī na makūmi atandatū, kūnū bazwalile shizwalo sha magūnīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba hū yene ī mizeituni īy'ībīlī; h'a makīndīkīlo ga tala ay'abīlī, abo bakīmīīlaga kū būtongi bo ng'wa Seeba, ū ng'wenekīlī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūkooba kūbīītīla yabūbi, gūkafumaga moto ū mu milomo yabo gwabakenaagūla a banishi babo; h'ūmo shiigelile achīle ū wa kūgaaganha kūbīītīla yabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi balī na būdūla bo kūlīlugala ī ligūlū ītizūtūla mbula ū mu shikū ja būhangi wabo. Na balī na būdūla bo kūgagalūcha a minzī gabize mininga; na badūgije kwītūla ī sī na mahūūya ga būlī mbika ng'hangala jose jose, gīt'ūmo būtogelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlū būmala kūfunya ū būhangi wabo, īkūgulumūka shiinū kūfuma ng'wishimayenze, yize kwilwisha būlūgū nabo; īkūbapyena ībabūlage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mibīlī yabo īkūlambalala hanze ng'wibbalabbala lya nzengo ntaale, ūyo gūkahayiagwa Sodoma na Misili, ū mu kitanīle ka kūfuba; h'ūko akakomelwa nū Seeba wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū ba ng'anda jose na ndīmi jose na mahanga gose bakwīyiloleela ī mibimba yabo ikanza lya shikū idatū na nusu; nīyo batūzunya gīkī ījīkwe mu shigila ī mibimba yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bikaji ba mu sī bakūyega na kayegele kataale kūlwa nguno yabo a bahangi benabo, bakūyinong'ha kūlwa kwihoja boi benekīlī na benekīlī, nguno a bahangi benabo baalī babaluhya no a bikaji ba mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho jabīta shikū idatū na nusu, moyo gwa būpanga kūfuma kūlī Mulungu gūkabingīla, būbūūka bīmīīla na magūlū gabo! Abo bakabona bakagwīlwa booba būtaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bahangi benabo bigwa ilaka itaale kūfuma ng'wigūlū līlībawīla gīkī, “Linhagi ng'wize kūūnū!” Būsolwa ilunde būlinha kūja ng'wigūlū, kūnū a banishi babo biloleelile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo yilonga nyahīnga nhaale; īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya nzengo yūkenaagūka, banhū shihūmbī mpungatī būyagala ū mu nyahīnga yenīyo; abo bakasaaga ho bakogoha na kogohele kataale no, būng'winha ikūjo ū Mulungu wa ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbiza bobīta nū būluhiwa bo kabīlī; alīyo managi gīkī ū būluhiwa bo kadatū būliza wangū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ipembe lya mpungatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū malaika wa mpungatī ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; gūhamuka malaka mataale kūfuma ng'wigūlū galīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna yūlugūlwa ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu ū ng'wigūlū, lyūbonwa isandīko lya būlagane bokwe, īlo līlī mu hekalu yakwe; jūbiza ho ndabi na mihilimo na kūpalalūka, na nyahīnga na mbula nhaale ya mawe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
